{"2311230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Passage: A Job Interview Simulator!", "steam_appid": 2311230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/f56ccaaa3eac765ea43ffed859170211.poster.avif?t=1787112434\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/f56ccaaa3eac765ea43ffed859170211.webm?t=1787112434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/f56ccaaa3eac765ea43ffed859170211.mp4?t=1787112434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What would you do if your pet cat transformed into an ancient Egyptian god?</h2>In Passage: A Job Interview Simulator, take on the role of a destitute job-seeker, making tough decisions while you manage seeking a career in the hyper-competitive job market. Luckily, you’ve got your pet cat to help with work-life balance! <br><br>Passage includes a branching narrative spanning 8+ hours of gameplay, an original storyline, original character art, an immersive OST, and 5 unique endings!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JUMP INTO THE WORLD OF A GRADUATE JOBSEEKER</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/1e1df66c7b43a67dd46b03dc212af12a.poster.avif?t=1787112434\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/1e1df66c7b43a67dd46b03dc212af12a.webm?t=1787112434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2311230/extras/1e1df66c7b43a67dd46b03dc212af12a.mp4?t=1787112434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></s